{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Snaps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the depths of thrilling dungeons and defend your village in this high-octane first-person shooter and tower defense hybrid! Armed with customizable weapons and your wits, face off against cunning cultists, build formidable defenses, and foster relationships with the locals in a vibrant village.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a seamless blend of intense gunplay and strategic planning as you navigate through cultist-infested dungeons to collect bounties and treasures. Back on the surface, use your hard-earned resources to construct towers and barricades, safeguarding your village from relentless attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic FPS Combat:</strong> Use your sub-machine gun and grenades with extensive customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Exploration:</strong> Delve into challenging dungeons filled with deadly cultists and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Defense Mechanics:</strong> Strategically build defenses to protect your village from waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich NPC Interactions:</strong> Engage in deep conversations, flirt, argue, or even marry village inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village Life:</strong> Trade goods, manage social relations via 'social media', and influence the village dynamics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casino and Gambling:</strong> Take a break at the casino, where you can gamble to win resources or just for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're battling through dungeons, strategizing over village defenses, or interacting with unique NPCs, <i>Snaps</i> offers a rich and varied gameplay experience designed to keep you engaged for hours. Prepare to be captivated by a world where every bullet counts and every relationship matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2968850?t=1756779678","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968850/78b4eef7242a54b2cddf848d6aa6fe9ca8fbb948/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756779678","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968850/79372c9d3e34f4e13ba1b17f0b4652bdb895239d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756779678","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968850/79372c9d3e34f4e13ba1b17f0b4652bdb895239d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756779678","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mild mature themes that may not be suitable for all ages or audiences. It includes:\r\n\r\n[i]Somewhat revealing outfits[/i] typically associated with anime aesthetics.\r\n[i]Images and references to alcohol and tobacco[/i] in certain game scenes.\r\n[i]Suggestive conversations[/i] and flirting among characters, which may imply deeper relationships but are presented in a light-hearted manner.\r\n[i]Gambling[/i] as part of the gameplay, involving in-game currency at a fictional casino.\r\nPlease note, all content is presented in a stylized, fictional context."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Snaps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the depths of thrilling dungeons and defend your village in this high-octane first-person shooter and tower defense hybrid! Armed with customizable weapons and your wits, face off against cunning cultists, build formidable defenses, and foster relationships with the locals in a vibrant village.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a seamless blend of intense gunplay and strategic planning as you navigate through cultist-infested dungeons to collect bounties and treasures. Back on the surface, use your hard-earned resources to construct towers and barricades, safeguarding your village from relentless attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic FPS Combat:</strong> Use your sub-machine gun and grenades with extensive customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Exploration:</strong> Delve into challenging dungeons filled with deadly cultists and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Defense Mechanics:</strong> Strategically build defenses to protect your village from waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich NPC Interactions:</strong> Engage in deep conversations, flirt, argue, or even marry village inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village Life:</strong> Trade goods, manage social relations via 'social media', and influence the village dynamics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casino and Gambling:</strong> Take a break at the casino, where you can gamble to win resources or just for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're battling through dungeons, strategizing over village defenses, or interacting with unique NPCs, <i>Snaps</i> offers a rich and varied gameplay experience designed to keep you engaged for hours. Prepare to be captivated by a world where every bullet counts and every relationship matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["RoadTato Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968850/9a0e4bac5317fb446f6254bfdd68b9d0b8dacc17/header.jpg?t=1756779678","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2968850/25061428/3d5a9330b452d96df90fc18a4f5cb880470d2059/1756754809/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756779445","dash_h264":"https://video.ak